---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: Outreach Agent at a glance
    accDescr: Telegram and the owner dashboard share one LangGraph agent and saved queue. Questions, files and web research return sourced answers. Explicit email requests prepare Gmail drafts. Progress is saved in SQLite or PostgreSQL.
    telegram["Telegram"] --> agent["LangGraph agent"]
    dashboard["Dashboard"] --> agent
    agent --> research["Research + files"]
    research --> answer["Answer + sources"]
    agent --> email["Requested emails"]
    email --> gmail["Gmail drafts"]
    agent -. Save progress .-> state[("Saved state")]
    classDef interface fill:#edf3fc,stroke:#8da6c7,color:#243b58;
    classDef result fill:#eef8f6,stroke:#78aaa0,color:#163b36;
    classDef storage fill:#f4f1fb,stroke:#ada0c7,color:#4c3b67;
    class telegram,dashboard interface;
    class answer,gmail result;
    class state storage;
